title: "Behavioral Experiment Simulation Tool"
type: software
version: "1.2.9.1"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
authors:
  - family-names: Dimant
    given-names: Eugen
    website: "https://eugendimant.github.io/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eugendimant/research-simulations"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit application that turns a Qualtrics survey file into a synthetic dataset for testing
  survey logic and analysis code before data collection, and for teaching. Simulated participants
  have response styles, optional built-in effects and open-ended text. The output is synthetic and
  is not data about real people.
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - survey simulation
  - experiment design
  - Qualtrics
  - research methods
  - teaching
